{"id":"nyamuru_voice_1690","text":"残しておきたいのは、今開いている作品のこの状態。保存まで済ませてもらおう。","label":"save","slots":{"target":"current_document"},"group":"v03_extra_test_focused_state_before_save","tags":["synthetic_evaluation","new_test","contract_only_authoring","replacement_candidate"],"note":"残す状態を主題化してから通常保存を依頼。別の編集や名前変更は含まない。","source":"codex_synthetic","review_status":"pending_user_review"}
{"id":"nyamuru_voice_1691","text":"名前を付け直す必要はないよ。「保存」の操作だけ、いまお願い。","label":"save","slots":{"target":"current_document"},"group":"v03_extra_test_named_save_excluding_rename","tags":["synthetic_evaluation","new_test","contract_only_authoring","replacement_candidate"],"note":"名前変更を不実行とし、操作名を引用した現在の通常保存だけを依頼。","source":"codex_synthetic","review_status":"pending_user_review"}
{"id":"nyamuru_voice_1692","text":"戻したいのはページじゃなくて、いま完了した編集のほう。取り消しを一段お願い。","label":"undo","slots":{"count":1},"group":"v03_extra_test_back_operation_disambiguation","tags":["synthetic_evaluation","new_test","contract_only_authoring","replacement_candidate"],"note":"ページ移動を否定し、完了した直前編集のUndoを一回求める。","source":"codex_synthetic","review_status":"pending_user_review"}
{"id":"nyamuru_voice_1693","text":"Undoは一回だけでお願い。いま完了した編集は取り消して、それ以前の変更は残してね。","label":"undo","slots":{"count":1},"group":"v03_extra_test_history_preserve_remainder","tags":["synthetic_evaluation","new_test","contract_only_authoring","replacement_candidate"],"note":"先に操作回数を指定し、取り消す編集と保持する編集を切り分ける。Undo一回の言い換えで複数操作ではない。","source":"codex_synthetic","review_status":"pending_user_review"}
{"id":"nyamuru_voice_1694","text":"二回分でお願い、Undoのことね。直近二つの編集を取り消すところで止めて。","label":"undo","slots":{"count":2},"group":"v03_extra_test_count_then_operation_identification","tags":["synthetic_evaluation","new_test","contract_only_authoring","replacement_candidate"],"note":"回数を先出ししたあとUndoと対象履歴を説明。同じUndoの反復回数なので一ラベル。","source":"codex_synthetic","review_status":"pending_user_review"}
{"id":"nyamuru_voice_1695","text":"再生成は頼んでないよ。さっきUndoで消した編集を戻すほう、Redoを一回やって。","label":"redo","slots":{"count":1},"group":"v03_extra_test_redo_not_regeneration","tags":["synthetic_evaluation","new_test","contract_only_authoring","replacement_candidate"],"note":"画像再生成を否定し、Undo済み編集の再適用を一回明示。","source":"codex_synthetic","review_status":"pending_user_review"}
{"id":"nyamuru_voice_1696","text":"Undoで二件取り消したうち、最後に取り消した一件だけを復元して。もう一件は取り消したままでいい。","label":"redo","slots":{"count":1},"group":"v03_extra_test_history_preserve_remainder","tags":["synthetic_evaluation","new_test","contract_only_authoring","replacement_candidate"],"note":"Undoで取り消した順序の最後から一件だけRedo。残りを再適用しないという範囲制約。","source":"codex_synthetic","review_status":"pending_user_review"}
{"id":"nyamuru_voice_1697","text":"九ページを見たいんだけど、ページを作り足す意味じゃないよ。表示先をそこに変えて。","label":"page_navigate","slots":{"page_number":9},"group":"v03_extra_test_page_destination_not_creation","tags":["synthetic_evaluation","new_test","contract_only_authoring","replacement_candidate"],"note":"移動先のページ番号を先出しし、追加を否定して表示切替を依頼。","source":"codex_synthetic","review_status":"pending_user_review"}
{"id":"nyamuru_voice_1698","text":"「戻る」は編集の取り消しじゃなく、ページを一つ前に送る意味でお願い。","label":"page_navigate","slots":{"direction":"previous","count":1},"group":"v03_extra_test_back_operation_disambiguation","tags":["synthetic_evaluation","new_test","contract_only_authoring","replacement_candidate"],"note":"戻るという語の意味を同一発話で前ページ移動に限定し、現在の実行を依頼。","source":"codex_synthetic","review_status":"pending_user_review"}
{"id":"nyamuru_voice_1699","text":"どのページを開くかは、作品の最後のページに決めたよ。今の表示をそこへ移して。","label":"page_navigate","slots":{"position":"last"},"group":"v03_extra_test_chosen_page_end_then_reference","tags":["synthetic_evaluation","new_test","contract_only_authoring","replacement_candidate"],"note":"作品の末尾ページを先に確定し、後続の参照で表示移動を依頼。","source":"codex_synthetic","review_status":"pending_user_review"}
{"id":"nyamuru_voice_1700","text":"次のページへ進む操作を二回続けて。間のページで止まらなくていいよ。","label":"page_navigate","slots":{"direction":"next","count":2},"group":"v03_extra_test_repeat_next_page_operation","tags":["synthetic_evaluation","new_test","contract_only_authoring","replacement_candidate"],"note":"同じ次ページ移動を二回行う指定。独立した二操作への分解ではない。","source":"codex_synthetic","review_status":"pending_user_review"}
{"id":"nyamuru_voice_1701","text":"最初に戻って。作品の一ページ目を表示して、という意味ね。","label":"page_navigate","slots":{"position":"first"},"group":"v03_extra_test_page_start_afterthought_repair","tags":["synthetic_evaluation","new_test","contract_only_authoring","replacement_candidate"],"note":"先行する戻るの意味を後置説明で作品の先頭ページ表示に確定。","source":"codex_synthetic","review_status":"pending_user_review"}
{"id":"nyamuru_voice_1704","text":"十一ページの次のページを開いて。今の表示位置ではなく、十一ページを基準にしてね。","label":"page_navigate","slots":{"page_number":12},"group":"v03_extra_test_explicit_page_anchor_relative_destination","tags":["synthetic_evaluation","new_test","replacement_candidate","post_authoring_family_revision"],"note":"十一ページという明示基準の次、すなわち十二ページへの単一表示移動。現在表示からの相対移動を否定しており、十一ページを開く追加操作は求めない。旧・public・devの構文を比較した後の改稿であり、blind authoringではない。","source":"codex_synthetic","review_status":"pending_user_review"}
